ase2.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></span></span> 2\n</th></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"barbox\" style=\"font-size:88%;overflow-x:auto;display:table;padding:0.4em;border:1px solid silver;width:900px;background:var(--background-color-neutral-subtle,white);color:inherit;margin:\">\n<table style=\"text-align:left; border-collapse:collapse; width:100%;\">\n<caption style=\"font-weight:bold;color:var(--color-base,#202122);background:#ddd\">House seats</caption>\n<tbody><tr style=\"height:4px;\">\n<th scope=\"col\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"padding:0 4px; text-align:left;\"></th>\n<td style=\"width:710px;\"></td>\n<th scope=\"col\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"padding:0 4px; width:1em; text-align:right;\"></th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-left: 0.4em; padding-right: 0.4em; min-width: 8em;\">Republican</td>\n<td style=\"width: 100px; border-left: solid 1px silver; border-right: solid 1px silver;\"><div style=\"background:#E81B23;color:inherit; width:50.6%; overflow: hidden;\">&#8201;</div></td>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-left: 1.2em; padding-right: 0.4em; text-align: right;\">50.6%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-left: 0.4em; padding-right: 0.4em; min-width: 8em;\">Democratic</td>\n<td style=\"width: 100px; border-left: solid 1px silver; border-right: solid 1px silver;\"><div style=\"background:#0044C9;color:inherit; width:49.4%; overflow: hidden;\">&#8201;</div></td>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-left: 1.2em; padding-right: 0.4em; text-align: right;\">49.4%</td>\n</tr>\n\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Maps\">Maps</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2024_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Maps\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 325.33333333333px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 323.33333333333px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:119th_US_Congress_House_Start.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"House seats by party holding majority in state\"><img alt=\"House seats by party holding majority in state\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/50/119th_US_Congress_House_Start.svg/500px-119th_US_Congress_House_Start.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"324\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/50/119th_US_Congress_House_Start.svg/1280px-119th_US_Congress_House_Start.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"512\" data-file-height=\"317\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">House seats by party holding majority in state</div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 325.33333333333px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 323.33333333333px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:2024_Changes_to_U.S._House_Delegations.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Net changes to U.S. House seats after the 2024 elections &#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;+1 Dem House seat &#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;+3 Dem House seats &#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;+1 Rep House seat &#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;+2 Rep House seats &#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;+3 Rep House seats\"><img alt=\"Net changes to U.S. House seats after the 2024 elections &#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;+1 Dem House seat &#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;+3 Dem House seats &#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;+1 Rep House seat &#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;+2 Rep House seats &#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;+3 Rep House seats\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ad/2024_Changes_to_U.S._House_Delegations.svg/500px-2024_Changes_to_U.S._House_Delegations.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"324\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ad/2024_Changes_to_U.S._House_Delegations.svg/1280px-2024_Changes_to_U.S._House_Delegations.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"512\" data-file-height=\"317\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Net changes to U.S. House seats after the 2024 elections<br /><span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#55DDFF; color:#55DDFF;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;+1 Dem House seat</span> <span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#6674DE; color:#6674DE;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;+3 Dem House seats</span><br /><span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#ff9999; color:#ff9999;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;+1 Rep House seat</span> <span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#ff6666; color:#ff6666;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;+2 Rep House seats</span><br /><span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#ff0000; color:#ff0000;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;+3 Rep House seats</span></div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 324px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 322px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:2024_US_House_of_Representatives_Election_by_States.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Popular vote and seat total in each state\"><img alt=\"Popular vote and seat total in each state\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/52/2024_US_House_of_Representatives_Election_by_States.svg/500px-2024_US_House_of_Representatives_Election_by_States.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"322\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/52/2024_US_House_of_Representatives_Election_by_States.svg/1280px-2024_US_House_of_Representatives_Election_by_States.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"512\" data-file-height=\"318\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Popular vote and seat total in each state</div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 324px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 322px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:2024_US_House_of_Representatives_elections,_winner_vote_share.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Winner&#39;s vote share in each district\"><img alt=\"Winner&#39;s vote share in each district\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cc/2024_US_House_of_Representatives_elections%2C_winner_vote_share.svg/500px-2024_US_House_of_Representatives_elections%2C_winner_vote_share.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"322\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cc/2024_US_House_of_Representatives_elections%2C_winner_vote_share.svg/1280px-2024_US_House_of_Representatives_elections%2C_winner_vote_share.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"512\" data-file-height=\"318\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Winner's vote share in each district</div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Retirements\">Retirements</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2024_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Retirements\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:2024_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_retirements_or_losses_of_renomination_map.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d5/2024_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_retirements_or_losses_of_renomination_map.svg/500px-2024_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_retirements_or_losses_of_renomination_map.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"350\" height=\"217\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d5/2024_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_retirements_or_losses_of_renomination_map.svg/960px-2024_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_retirements_or_losses_of_renomination_map.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"512\" data-file-height=\"318\" /></a><figcaption>Retiring incumbents by district<br /><span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#92C5DE; color:#92C5DE;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;Democratic incumbent ran</span><br /><span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#0671B0; color:#0671B0;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;Democratic incumbent retired or lost renomination</span><br /><span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#F48882; color:#F48882;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;Republican incumbent ran</span><br /><span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#CA0120; color:#CA0120;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;Republican incumbent retired or lost renomination</span><br /><span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#6D6D6D; color:#6D6D6D;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;Vacant or no incumbent ran</span></figcaption></figure>\n<p>A total of 46 representatives and 2 non-voting delegates (25 Democrats and 23 Republicans) retired, 19 of whom (12 Democrats and 7 Republicans) retired to run for other offices.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Democratic\">Democratic</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2024_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Democratic\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r1184024115\">.mw-parser-output .div-col{margin-top:0.3em;column-width:30em}.mw-parser-output .div-col-small{font-size:90%}.mw-parser-output .div-col-rules{column-rule:1px solid #aaa}.mw-parser-output .div-col dl,.mw-parser-output .div-col ol,.mw-parser-output .div-col ul{margin-top:0}.mw-parser-output .div-col li,.mw-parser-output .div-col dd{page-break-inside:avoid;break-inside:avoid-column}</style><div class=\"div-col\">\n<ol><li><span data-sort-value=\"Arizona03&#160;!\"><a href=\"/wiki/Arizona%27s_3rd_congressional_district\" title=\"Arizona&#39;s 3rd congressional district\">Arizona&#160;3</a></span>: <a href=\"/wiki/Ruben_Gallego\" title=\"Ruben Gallego\">Ruben Gallego</a> retired to <a href=\"/wiki/2024_United_States_Senate_election_in_Arizona\" title=\"2024 United States Senate election in Arizona\">run for the U.S. Senate</a>.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Gallego&#95;15-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Gallego-15\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>13<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></li>\n<li><span data-sort-value=\"California12&#160;!\"><a href=\"/wiki/California%27s_12th_congressional_district\" title=\"California&#39;s 12th congressional district\">California&#160;12</a></span>: <a href=\"/wiki/Barbara_Lee\" title=\"Barbara Lee\">Barbara Lee</a> retired to <a href=\"/wiki/2024_United_States_Senate_election_in_California\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2024 United States Senate election in California\">run for the U.S. Senate</a>.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-LeeCA&#95;16-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-LeeCA-16\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>14<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></li>\n<li><span data-sort-value=\"California16&#160;!\"><a href=\"/wiki/California%27s_16th_congressional_district\" title=\"California&#39;s 16th congressional district\">California&#160;16</a></span>: <a href=\"/wiki/Anna_Eshoo\" title=\"Anna Eshoo\">Anna Eshoo</a> retired.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Anna16&#95;17-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Anna16-17\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>15<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></li>\n<li><span data-sort-value=\"California29&#160;!\"><a href=\"/wiki/California%27s_29th_congressional_district\" title=\"California&#39;s 29th congressional district\">California&#160;29</a></span>: <a href=\"/wiki/Tony_C%C3%A1rdenas\" title=\"Tony Cárdenas\">Tony Cárdenas</a> retired.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-CardenasCA&#95;18-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-CardenasCA-18\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>16<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></li>\n<li><span data-sort-value=\"California30&#160;!\"><a href=\"/wiki/California%27s_30th_congressional_district\" title=\"California&#39;s 30th congressional district\">California&#160;30</a></span>: <a href=\"/wiki/Adam_Schiff\" title=\"Adam Schiff\">Adam Schiff</a> retired to <a href=\"/wiki/2024_United_States_Senate_election_in_California\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2024 United States Senate election in California\">run for the U.S. Senate</a>.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Schiff&#95;19-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Schiff-19\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>17<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></li>\n<li><span data-sort-value=\"California31&#160;!\"><a href=\"/wiki/California%27s_31st_congressional_district\" title=\"California&#39;s 31st congressional district\">California&#160;31</a></span>: <a href=\"/wiki/Grace_Napolitano\" title=\"Grace Napolitano\">Grace Napolitano</a> retired.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Napolitano&#95;20-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Napolitano-20\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>18<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></li>\n<li><span data-sort-value=\"California47&#160;!\"><a href=\"/wiki/California%27s_47th_congressional_district\" title=\"California&#39;s 47th congressional district\">California&#160;47</a></span>: <a href=\"/wiki/Katie_Porter\" title=\"Katie Porter\">Katie Porter</a> retired to <a href=\"/wiki/2024_United_States_Senate_election_in_California\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2024 United States Senate election in California\">run for the U.S. Senate</a>.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-KatiePorter&#95;21-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-KatiePorter-21\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>19<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></li>\n<li><span data-sort-value=\"DelawareAL&#160;!\"><a href=\"/wiki/Delaware%27s_at-large_congressional_district\" title=\"Delaware&#39;s at-large congressional district\">Delaware&#160;at-large</a></span>: <a href=\"/wiki/Lisa_Blunt_Rochester\" title=\"Lisa Blunt Rochester\">Lisa Blunt Rochester</a> retired to <a href=\"/wiki/2024_United_States_Senate_election_in_Delaware\" title=\"2024 United States Senate election in Delaware\">run for the U.S. Senate</a>.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-BluntRochester&#95;22-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-BluntRochester-22\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>20<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></li>\n<li><span data-sort-value=\"Maryland02&#160;!\"><a href=\"/wiki/Maryland%27s_2nd_congressional_district\" title=\"Maryland&#39;s 2nd congressional district\">Maryland&#160;2</a></span>: <a href=\"/wiki/Dutch_Ruppersberger\" title=\"Dutch Ruppersberger\">Dutch Ruppersberger</a> retired.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-RuppersbergerMD&#95;23-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-RuppersbergerMD-23\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>21<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></li>\n<li><span data-sort-value=\"Maryland03&#160;!\"><a href=\"/wiki/Maryland%27s_3rd_congressional_district\" title=\"Maryland&#39;s 3rd congressional district\">Maryland&#160;3</a></span>: <a href=\"/wiki/John_Sarbanes\" title=\"John Sarbanes\">John Sarbanes</a> retired.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SarbanesMD&#95;24-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SarbanesMD-24\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>22<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></li>\n<li><span data-sort-value=\"Maryland06&#160;!\"><a href=\"/wiki/Maryland%27s_6th_congressional_district\" title=\"Maryland&#39;s 6th congressional district\">Maryland&#160;6</a></span>: <a href=\"/wiki/David_Trone\" title=\"David Trone\">David Trone</a> retired to <a href=\"/wiki/2024_United_States_Senate_election_in_Maryland\" title=\"2024 United States Senate election in Maryland\">run for the U.S. Senate</a>.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-DavidTrone&#95;25-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-DavidTrone-25\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>23<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></li>\n<li><span data-sort-value=\"Michigan07&#160;!\"><a href=\"/wiki/Michigan%27s_7th_congressional_district\" title=\"Michigan&#39;s 7th congressional district\">Michigan&#160;7</a></span>: <a href=\"/wiki/Elissa_Slotkin\" title=\"Elissa Slotkin\">El