=\"96.8&#160;!\">D+3.2</span><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Nickel&#95;91-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Nickel-91\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>e<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</td>\n<td style=\"color:black; background-color:#FFB6B6\" data-sort-value=\"1\"><a href=\"/wiki/Brad_Knott\" title=\"Brad Knott\">Knott</a> <small>(flip)</small>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th><span data-sort-value=\"North Carolina14&#160;!\"><a href=\"/wiki/North_Carolina%27s_14th_congressional_district\" title=\"North Carolina&#39;s 14th congressional district\">North Carolina&#160;14</a></span>\n</th>\n<td style=\"color:black; background-color:#FFB6B6\"><span data-sort-value=\"111&#160;!\">R+11</span><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Redistrict&#95;89-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Redistrict-89\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>c<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</td>\n<td style=\"color:black; background-color:#FFB6B6\"><span data-sort-value=\"116.1&#160;!\">R+16.1</span>\n</td>\n<td><span data-sort-value=\"Jackson, Jeff\"><span class=\"vcard\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jeff_Jackson_(politician)\" title=\"Jeff Jackson (politician)\">Jeff Jackson</a></span></span></span><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Jackson&#95;92-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Jackson-92\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>f<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><br /><small>(retiring)</small>\n</td>\n<td style=\"color:black;background-color:#B0CEFF\">Democratic\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/2022_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_North_Carolina#District_14\" title=\"2022 United States House of Representatives elections in North Carolina\">2022</a>\n</td>\n<td style=\"color:black;background-color:#B0CEFF\"><span data-sort-value=\"84.6&#160;!\">D+15.4</span><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Jackson&#95;92-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Jackson-92\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>f<span class=\"cit