ns for 2026 instead\"</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_News_%26_Observer\" title=\"The News &amp; Observer\">The News &amp; Observer</a></i><span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">December 14,</span> 2023</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=The+News+%26+Observer&amp;rft.atitle=Wake%27s+Rep.+Wiley+Nickel+won%27t+run+for+reelection.+He%27s+making+plans+for+2026+instead.&amp;rft.date=2023-12-14&amp;rft.aulast=Battaglia&amp;rft.aufirst=Danielle&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.newsobserver.com%2Fnews%2Fpolitics-government%2Felection%2Farticle283010413.html&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2024+United+States+House+of+Representatives+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-JacksonNC-34\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-JacksonNC_34-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-JacksonNC_34-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFBattaglia2023\" class=\"citation web cs1\">Battaglia, Danielle (October 26, 2023). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.charlotteobserver.com/news/politics-government/article280959918.html\">\"Jeff Jackson, a target of GOP maps, announces bid for NC attorney general\"</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Charlotte_Observer\" title=\"The Charlotte Observer\">The Charlotte Observer</a></i><span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">October 26,</span> 2023</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=The+Charlotte+Observer&amp;rft.atitle=Jeff+Jackson%2C+a+target+of+GOP+maps%2C+announces+bid+for+NC+attorney+general&amp;rft.date=2023-10-26&amp;rft