023%2F11%2F10%2F1204339156%2Flouisiana-congressional-districts-redistricting&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2024+United+States+House+of+Representatives+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-121\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-121\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFHutchinson2024\" class=\"citation news cs1\">Hutchinson, Piper (January 19, 2024). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://lailluminator.com/2024/01/19/graves-to-lose-u-s-house-seat-under-louisiana-redistricting-plan-that-adds-minority-seat/\">\"Graves to lose U.S. House seat under Louisiana redistricting plan that adds minority seat\"</a>. <i>Louisiana Illuminator</i>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=Louisiana+Illuminator&amp;rft.atitle=Graves+to+lose+U.S.+House+seat+under+Louisiana+redistricting+plan+that+adds+minority+seat&amp;rft.date=2024-01-19&amp;rft.aulast=Hutchinson&amp;rft.aufirst=Piper&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Flailluminator.com%2F2024%2F01%2F19%2Fgraves-to-lose-u-s-house-seat-under-louisiana-redistricting-plan-that-adds-minority-seat%2F&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2024+United+States+House+of+Representatives+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-LA&#95;map-122\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-LA_map_122-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-LA_map_122-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFHilburn2024\" class=\"citation web cs1\">Hilburn, Greg (January 22, 2024). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.shreveport