i&amp;rft.aufirst=Michael&amp;rft.au=Miller%2C+Peter&amp;rft.au=Feliz%2C+Gina&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.brennancenter.org%2Four-work%2Fanalysis-opinion%2Fanatomy-north-carolina-gerrymander&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2024+United+States+House+of+Representatives+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-130\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-130\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFPelzer2023\" class=\"citation news cs1\">Pelzer, Jeremy (September 7, 2023). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.cleveland.com/news/2023/09/ohio-will-use-same-unconstitutional-congressional-maps-in-2024-as-court-dismisses-legal-challenges.html\">\"Ohio will use congressional map previously ruled unconstitutional again in 2024, as court dismisses legal challenges\"</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/Cleveland_Plain_Dealer\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Cleveland Plain Dealer\">Cleveland Plain Dealer</a></i>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=Cleveland+Plain+Dealer&amp;rft.atitle=Ohio+will+use+congressional+map+previously+ruled+unconstitutional+again+in+2024%2C+as+court+dismisses+legal+challenges&amp;rft.date=2023-09-07&amp;rft.aulast=Pelzer&amp;rft.aufirst=Jeremy&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.cleveland.com%2Fnews%2F2023%2F09%2Fohio-will-use-same-unconstitutional-congressional-maps-in-2024-as-court-dismisses-legal-challenges.html&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2024+United+States+House+of+Representatives+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-131\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-131\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:Templ