es%2Fsouth-carolina-redistricting-challenge%2F&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2024+United+States+House+of+Representatives+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-133\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-133\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite class=\"citation web cs1\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://thearp.org/litigation/tennessee-naacp-v-lee/\">\"Tennessee State Conference of the NAACP, et.al. V. William B. Lee\"</a>. <i>The American Redistricting Project</i>. September 25, 2024.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=The+American+Redistricting+Project&amp;rft.atitle=Tennessee+State+Conference+of+the+NAACP%2C+et.al.+V.+William+B.+Lee&amp;rft.date=2024-09-25&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fthearp.org%2Flitigation%2Ftennessee-naacp-v-lee%2F&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2024+United+States+House+of+Representatives+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-134\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-134\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFSelzer,&#95;Rachel2023\" class=\"citation web cs1\">Selzer, Rachel (August 9, 2023). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.democracydocket.com/news-alerts/civil-rights-groups-file-federal-lawsuit-over-tennessees-congressional-and-state-senate-maps/\">\"Civil Rights Groups File Federal Lawsuit Over Tennessee's Congressional and State Senate Maps\"</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/Democracy_Docket\" title=\"Democracy Docket\">Democracy Docket</a></i><span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">November 9,<